---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: New to Numina
section: New to Numina
---
<div class="shell">
  {% include "partials/sidebar.njk" %}
  <main>
    <h1>New to Numina</h1>
    <p class="lede">Everything the rulebook doesn't cover: what a weekend actually feels like, what to
    pack, how to try NPCing, and the story so far — written by and for the people who show up and play it.</p>
    <p>Looking for the rules themselves? <a href="/mechanics/new-players/">Start with New Players Start Here.</a></p>
    {% include "partials/ornaments/divider.njk" %}
    <div class="card-grid">
      {% set navSection = nav.sections | sectionForTitle("New to Numina") %}
      {% for pg in navSection.pages %}
      {% set entry = collections.all | pageByUrl(pg.url) %}
      <a class="card" href="{{ pg.url }}">
        <h2>{{ pg.title }}</h2>
        {% if entry %}<p>{{ entry.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </main>
</div>
